{"title":"AoPS Wiki:Chess","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:1px solid #999; background: #fff; margin: .3em .3em .3em 1em; padding: 3px; float:right\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<span id=\"shortcut\"><b>Shortcut</b>:<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A:CHESS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A:CHESS\">A:CHESS</a></div>\n</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>How to play a game of chess on the AoPSWiki:\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Starting_a_game\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Starting a game</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Moving_pieces\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Moving pieces</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Games/Tournaments\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Games/Tournaments</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Starting_a_game\">Starting a game</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Chess&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Starting a game\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On a page, add the following lines:\n</p>\n<pre> \n{{Template:Chess position|&lt;!--\n 8 --&gt;rd|nd|bd|qd|kd|bd|nd|rd|&lt;!--\n 7 --&gt;pd|pd|pd|pd|pd|pd|pd|pd|&lt;!--\n 6 --&gt;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |&lt;!--\n 5 --&gt;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |&lt;!--\n 4 --&gt;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |&lt;!--\n 3 --&gt;  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |&lt;!--\n 2 --&gt;pl|pl|pl|pl|pl|pl|pl|pl|&lt;!--\n 1 --&gt;rl|nl|bl|ql|kl|bl|nl|rl|30}}\n &lt;!-- a  b  c  d  e  f  g  h   --&gt;\n</pre>\n<p>Here, the notation stands for:\n</p>\n<ul><li>l and d stand for white and black sides (light and dark).</li>\n<li>p stands for pawn, r stands for rook, n stands for knight, b stands for bishop, q stands for queen, and k stands for king.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Moving_pieces\">Moving pieces</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Chess&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Moving pieces\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The row and columns are numbered by the MediaWiki comments. To move a piece, simply delete the two letters representing the piece in the original position and paste them into the square you wish to move them into. To capture, delete the piece being captured.\n</p><p>It is advisable to keep track of the moves during the game in order to keep it more organized, though it can be tracked via the history tab.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Games.2FTournaments\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Games/Tournaments\">Games/Tournaments</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Chess&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Games/Tournaments\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Chess&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Piphi/Games\" title=\"User:Piphi/Games\">User:Piphi/Games</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Piphi/Chess\" title=\"User:Piphi/Chess\">User:Piphi/Chess</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017101751\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 257/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 413/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.645      1 Template:Shortcut\n100.00%    5.645      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5293:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017101751 and revision id 250897. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}